{
  "schema": 1,
  "title_id": "5841122D",
  "note": "P3 inventory of lazy and startup graphics/compute pipelines the renderer creates outside the guest .xpso recipe stores. Recipes are normalized descriptions plus their creation key and dependencies; no shader bytes. trace.site is the exact site string the P0 shader_compile_trace instrument logs, so this file stays checkable against the SDK sources. coverage=site_unique means the trace site identifies one creation per process; coverage=key_identified means one trace site creates several pipelines and each creation now logs the caller's key (trace.key_bits documents its layout, so a logged key can be read back into a recipe); coverage=site_repeated would mean the key is still not carried and remains a blocker.",
